ea1i Tsubasa:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: L\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ng\u00e0nh h\u1ecdc:<\/strong> Ch\u00fang t\u00f4i gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ch\u1ecdn ng\u00e0nh h\u1ecdc ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhu c\u1ea7u th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng lao \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 s\u1edf th\u00edch c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: X\u1eed l\u00fd h\u1ed3 s\u01a1:<\/strong> Tsubasa h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb c\u00e1c gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft v\u00e0 chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb ph\u01b0\u01a1ng \u00e1n h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t cho b\u1ea1n nh\u01b0 ch\u1ee9ng minh thu nh\u1eadp, ch\u1ee9ng minh t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh, d\u1ecbch thu\u1eadt , xin x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn h\u1ee3p ph\u00e1p l\u00e3nh s\u1ef1,&#8230;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: \u0110\u00e0o t\u1ea1o ti\u1ebfng H\u00e0n:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c tham gia kh\u00f3a h\u1ecdc ti\u1ebfng H\u00e0n c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng cao \u0111\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng v\u01b0\u1ee3t qua ph\u1ecfng v\u1ea5n visa.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 h\u00f2a nh\u1eadp:<\/strong> Tsubasa gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n t\u00ecm ch\u1ed7 \u1edf, k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng du h\u1ecdc sinh Vi\u1ec7t Nam t\u1ea1i H\u00e0n Qu\u1ed1c, v\u00e0 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 trong c\u00e1c t\u00ecnh hu\u1ed1ng kh\u1ea9n c\u1ea5p.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>CH\u01af\u01a0NG TR\u00ccNH TUY\u1ec2N SINH DU H\u1eccC H\u00c0N QU\u1ed0C T\u1ea0I TSUBASA:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"724\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/duhocxkld-tsubasa.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/xkld-724x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8016\" style=\"width:837px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/duhocxkld-tsubasa.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/xkld-724x1024.jpg 724w, https:\/\/duhocxkld-